    vulkan_8k_jit_retained_host_buf_sample_crash_2026-08-12, 2, "2026-11-25/2026-11-27 triage (release/1.0.0 7ec0a1ed579): synced shard to commit 5b66216574f. All fix components confirmed present in tree: SkiaVulkanBackend rename + VulkanBackend alias (src/lib/skia/backend/vulkan/backend.spl:600-606), owner-local sample_host_mirror (src/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/engine2d/backend_vulkan.spl:2885), and both fixtures (jit_class_u32_array_retained_read/main.spl, jit_vulkan_host_mirror_64_row_sample/). Stays open only for Linux lavapipe strict-JIT fixture & 8K timing/parity receipt (not runnable on this Windows host)."
    vulkan_8k_jit_retained_host_buf_sample_crash_2026-08-12, 3, "2026-11-28 gui-vulkan-p2 lane (linux-aarch64 GB10, release/1.0.0 8dd50786560): crash NO LONGER REPRODUCES. The old reproducer test/05_perf/graphics_2d/bench_vulkan_8k_retained_damage.spl did not compile under SIMPLE_JIT_STRICT=1 (HIR: VulkanBackend has no field damage_readback_calls; present_damage_plan(DamageFramePlan) is absent from backend_vulkan.spl on release/1.0.0 and origin/main). Ported the bench to the production stage_present_damage+present route with per-frame receipt accumulation, kept the direct external host_buf[i] reads and added sample_host_mirror owner parity. seed /home/yoon/.cache/cargo-target-wm-unitalias-1126/release/simple sha256:352b80a734463098 (vulkan feature, 2026-11-26), SIMPLE_JIT_STRICT=1 7680x4320 10/200 frames: lavapipe status=pass p50=288148ns p95=696986ns calls=200 bytes=3276800 full_fallbacks=0 sampled_parity=true checksum=47068256682 maxRSS=1205296KiB rc=0; NVIDIA GB10 status=pass p50=148306ns p95=251220ns same transfer/parity maxRSS=1125568KiB rc=0. Fixing changes: 4051bc8c494 (SkiaVulkanBackend identity split) + fda534d0dd4 (owner-local sample_host_mirror). Reduction fixtures jit_class_u32_array_retained_read and jit_vulkan_host_mirror_64_row_sample PASS strict-JIT. Provenance: seed built from /home/yoon/dev/simple-seed-unit-scope-20261126 (merge-base e14c6c30055 plus unlanded seed commits 71eb0bdd009, d25b5aad4a5: unit-alias resolution, unrelated to Vulkan/array access), so the no-repro holds for the .spl tree 8dd50786560 on that seed. Each 8K log carries one [engine-demotion] reason=hybrid-interp-splice detail=rt_bytes_alloc,spl_str_ptr line (those two externs run interpreted; the host_buf reads and draw loop stayed JIT, no other fallback). bench rss_kb() reports 0 under strict JIT: tracked as bench_vulkan_8k_rss_kb_reports_zero_strict_jit_2026-11-28. Status -> fix-implemented-verification-pending pending independent review."

